WEBVTT

00:05:29.027 --> 00:05:30.967
Asante --

00:05:30.991 --> 00:05:32.750
ambapo unaweza kuagiza hasi brown

00:05:32.774 --> 00:05:35.927
kwa namna nyingi ambavyo
mtu anaweza kutupa mzoga wa binadamu ...

00:05:35.951 --> 00:05:37.584
(kicheko)

00:05:37.608 --> 00:05:42.337
imekatwa, ina pilipili, imewekwa topin,
iko vipande, na imefunikwa.

00:05:42.361 --> 00:05:44.464
(kicheko)

00:05:44.488 --> 00:05:45.933
Kama taratibu za kijamii zinavyoweka,

00:05:45.957 --> 00:05:49.454
unatakiwa kwenda Waffle House
mida isiyo ya kawaida usiku tu.

00:05:49.478 --> 00:05:50.629
(kicheko)

00:05:50.653 --> 00:05:55.009
Hivyo siku moja, saa 8 alfajiri, nilikuwa
naongea na muhudumu, nikamuuliza,

00:05:55.033 --> 00:05:58.303
"nikitu gani cha ajabu kimewahi kukutokea
katika kazi yako?"

00:05:58.873 --> 00:06:02.136
Na akaniambia wakati mmoja,
mwanaume aliingia akiwa uchi kabisa.